        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Event Ticketing MVP — Corrected Logical ERD&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Target model agreed during planning. H2-friendly, UUID primary keys, plural snake_case tables.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1">
